&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 120%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;As of March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;31, 2026, there are no energy commodity derivative contracts outstanding with expected settlements after 2029.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 120%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The following table presents the underlying energy commodity derivative volumes as of December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;31, 2025 expected to be settled in each respective year (in thousands of MWhs and mmBTUs):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
