&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 120%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Summary of Outstanding Derivative Instruments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; line-height: 120%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The amounts recorded on the Balance Sheet as of March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;31, 2026 and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;31, 2025 reflect the offsetting of derivative assets and liabilities where a legal right of offset exists.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
