&lt;p style="margin-top: 6pt; margin-bottom: 6pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; line-height: 120%; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The valuation methods, significant inputs and resulting fair values described above were developed by the Company and are reviewed on at least a quarterly basis to ensure they provide a reasonable estimate of fair value each reporting period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
